###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Other errors are stated approximately ('about', 'around') or only in figures (Figs. 4-7). The carbon energy sentence gives 0.101 and 0.012 eV for 'group energy, total energy' in an order inconsistent with the sulfur results, so it is not encoded. ACE failed with default pacemaker settings for carbon. The 2b/3b cosine and Gaussian and simplified DP feature models have no registry method (linear models on those descriptors).
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
